msgctxt "page.title"
msgid "sus.bot | robots.txt checker"
msgstr "sus.bot | preverjanje robots.txt"

msgctxt "page.description"
msgid "Free robots.txt checker. Fetch any site's robots.txt, see which search engines and AI crawlers are allowed or blocked, test paths against the rules, and check how the server responds to each crawler."
msgstr "Brezplačno preverjanje robots.txt. Pridobite robots.txt katerega koli spletnega mesta, poglejte, kateri iskalniki in pajki UI so dovoljeni ali blokirani, preizkusite poti glede na pravila in preverite, kako strežnik odgovarja posameznemu pajku."

msgctxt "page.skip"
msgid "Skip to content"
msgstr "Preskoči na vsebino"

msgctxt "page.h1"
msgid "Check and understand your robots.txt before traffic drops"
msgstr "Preverite in razumite svojo datoteko robots.txt, preden promet upade"

msgctxt "page.themeLabel"
msgid "Colour theme"
msgstr "Barvna tema"

msgctxt "ui.theme.toLight"
msgid "Switch to the light theme"
msgstr "Preklopi na svetlo temo"

msgctxt "ui.theme.toDark"
msgid "Switch to the dark theme"
msgstr "Preklopi na temno temo"

msgctxt "page.langLabel"
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Jezik"

msgctxt "page.intro"
msgid "Enter your domain above. You get a verdict for the business, a fix list that links to the exact lines, and a message you can send straight to IT."
msgstr "Vnesite svojo domeno zgoraj. Dobite sodbo za posel, seznam popravkov s povezavami na točne vrstice in sporočilo, ki ga lahko pošljete naravnost IT-ju."

msgctxt "page.urlLabel"
msgid "Domain, or any address on the site"
msgstr "Domena ali kateri koli naslov na spletnem mestu"

msgctxt "page.analyse"
msgid "Check robots.txt"
msgstr "Preveri robots.txt"

msgctxt "page.urlHint"
msgid "Paste whatever you have: a domain, a page, a link from an email, even the <code>robots.txt</code> address itself. We read <code>/robots.txt</code> from that site and ignore the rest."
msgstr "Prilepite, kar imate: domeno, stran, povezavo iz e-pošte ali celo sam naslov datoteke <code>robots.txt</code>. S tega spletnega mesta preberemo <code>/robots.txt</code>, preostalo pa prezremo."

msgctxt "page.pasteSummary"
msgid "Paste a robots.txt instead"
msgstr "Ali prilepite robots.txt"

msgctxt "page.pasteLabel"
msgid "robots.txt contents"
msgstr "Vsebina robots.txt"

msgctxt "page.analysePasted"
msgid "Analyse pasted text"
msgstr "Analiziraj prilepljeno besedilo"

msgctxt "page.loadExample"
msgid "Load the kitchen-sink example"
msgstr "Naloži celovit primer"

msgctxt "page.aiStatus"
msgid "AI scraping status"
msgstr "Stanje zbiranja podatkov za UI"

msgctxt "page.agents"
msgid "Crawler access"
msgstr "Dostop pajkov"

msgctxt "page.agentsIntro"
msgid "Resolved per crawler with RFC 9309 matching: the most specific group wins, then the longest rule, and ties go to <code>Allow</code>."
msgstr "Določeno za vsakega pajka po RFC 9309: zmaga najbolj specifična skupina, nato najdaljše pravilo, pri izenačenju pa <code>Allow</code>."

msgctxt "page.tester"
msgid "Test a path"
msgstr "Preizkusi pot"

msgctxt "page.access"
msgid "Real access by crawler"
msgstr "Dejanski dostop po pajkih"

msgctxt "page.accessIntro"
msgid "Request the file again through the proxy, identifying as each crawler in turn. A different status or body means the server treats that crawler differently (bot blocking, WAF rules, cloaking)."
msgstr "Datoteko znova zahteva prek posrednika in se pri tem po vrsti predstavi kot vsak pajek. Drugačen status ali vsebina pomeni, da strežnik tega pajka obravnava drugače (blokiranje botov, pravila WAF, cloaking)."

msgctxt "page.issues"
msgid "Issues"
msgstr "Težave"

msgctxt "page.security"
msgid "Security notes"
msgstr "Varnostne opombe"

msgctxt "page.securityIntro"
msgid "Disallow rules that name sensitive files and folders, which attackers look for first. This checks what the file reveals, not whether the paths exist or are protected."
msgstr "Pravila Disallow, ki navajajo občutljive datoteke in mape, te pa napadalci poiščejo najprej. Preverja se, kaj datoteka razkriva, ne ali poti obstajajo ali so zaščitene."

msgctxt "page.recon"
msgid "Reconnaissance"
msgstr "Izvidovanje"

msgctxt "page.reconIntro"
msgid "What a stranger learns about this site from the file alone: the platform it runs on, cloud buckets, other hostnames, API entry points, data feeds, file types, and notes left in comments. Nothing here is fetched or probed; it is read straight from the text."
msgstr "Kaj neznanec izve o tem spletnem mestu zgolj iz datoteke: platformo, oblačne vsebnike, druga imena gostiteljev, vstopne točke API, podatkovne vire, vrste datotek in zapiske v komentarjih. Tu se nič ne pridobiva ali preizkuša; vse se bere neposredno iz besedila."

msgctxt "page.sitemaps"
msgid "Sitemaps"
msgstr "Kazala spletnega mesta"

msgctxt "page.raw"
msgid "File contents"
msgstr "Vsebina datoteke"

msgctxt "page.footerRfc"
msgid "Rule matching follows <a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9309\" rel=\"noopener\">RFC 9309</a> and Google's published crawler behaviour."
msgstr "Ujemanje pravil sledi <a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9309\" rel=\"noopener\">RFC 9309</a> in vedenju pajkov, ki ga je objavil Google."

msgctxt "page.footerBy"
msgid "A free tool by <a href=\"https://sitefig.eu\" rel=\"noopener\">Sitefig</a>."
msgstr "Brezplačno orodje podjetja <a href=\"https://sitefig.eu\" rel=\"noopener\">Sitefig</a>."

msgctxt "page.noscript"
msgid "This tool runs entirely in your browser and needs JavaScript."
msgstr "To orodje deluje v celoti v vašem brskalniku in potrebuje JavaScript."

