msgid "Want to know when the fix is live? We check the file every day and email you when it changes. Free, no card. Want to watch competitors too? See below."
msgstr "Želite izvedeti, kdaj bo popravek objavljen? Datoteko preverimo vsak dan in vam pošljemo e-pošto, ko se spremeni. Brezplačno, brez kartice. Želite spremljati tudi konkurente? Poglejte spodaj."

msgctxt "ui.handoff.watchCta"
msgid "Watch for free"
msgstr "Spremljajte brezplačno"

msgctxt "ui.compare.eyebrow"
msgid "Next: how do you compare?"
msgstr "Naslednje: kako se primerjate z drugimi?"

msgctxt "ui.compare.title"
msgid "See what your competitor lets search engines and AI read"
msgstr "Poglejte, kaj vaš konkurent dovoli brati iskalnikom in UI"

msgctxt "ui.compare.body"
msgid "Every robots.txt is public. Compare yours with any competitor once, for free. If a competitor opens up to AI search or hides a category, that is a signal worth knowing about."
msgstr "Vsak robots.txt je javen. Svojega enkrat brezplačno primerjajte s katerim koli konkurentom. Če se konkurent odpre iskanju UI ali skrije kategorijo, je to znak, za katerega je vredno vedeti."

msgctxt "ui.compare.label"
