msgstr "To je današnji posnetek stanja. Prihodnji teden ga bodo spremenili."

msgctxt "ui.compare.upsell.body"
msgid "Watching keeps your own domains and your competitors under check, and tells you in plain language when one of them blocks or opens up to a crawler, hides a section or puts new pages out."
msgstr "Spremljanje nadzoruje vaše domene in vaše konkurente ter vam v preprostem jeziku sporoči, ko kdo od njih blokira pajka ali mu odpre dostop, skrije razdelek ali objavi nove strani."

msgctxt "ui.compare.cta"
msgid "Watch both"
msgstr "Spremljajte obe"

msgctxt "ui.appendix.body"
msgid "For whoever edits the file. Everything the report used to open with is still here, folded away."
msgstr "Za tistega, ki ureja datoteko. Vse, s čimer se je poročilo včasih začelo, je še vedno tukaj, le zloženo."

